OL,3,ALabour wins Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aby-election, beating Green leader Zack
OL,5,APolanski
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour has won the Holborn and St
OL,8,FPancras by-election for the seat
OL,9,Fvacated by former Prime Minister Keir
OL,10,FStarmer
OL,12,FCamden Council leader Sagal Abdi-Wali
OL,13,Freceived 12,292 votes, while Green
OL,14,Fleader Zack Polanski came in second
OL,15,Fwith 8,929
OL,17,FAbdi-Wali says it's an "extraordinary
OL,18,Fhonour" to represent Holborn and St
OL,19,FPancras as she addresses the crowd at
OL,20,Fthe count
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
