OL,3,ALabour wins Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aby-election, beating Green leader Zack
OL,5,APolanski
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe inner London constituency has been
OL,8,FLabour since it was created in 1983,
OL,9,Fwith the party taking at least 40% of
OL,10,Fthe vote at every general election
OL,12,FThe turnout in Thursday's vote is
OL,13,Fconfirmed as 38.76%, which is lower
OL,14,Fthan in 2024
